.TH PAGINA 1 "2026-09-20" "pagina 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pagina \- Markdown/HTML bidirectional converter
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pagina
.RB [ \-\-color =\fIauto\fR|\fIalways\fR|\fInever\fR ]
.B to-html
.RB [ \-\-gfm ]
.I input.md output.html
.br
.B pagina
.RB [ \-\-color =\fIauto\fR|\fIalways\fR|\fInever\fR ]
.B to-md
.RB [ \-\-gfm ]
.I input.html output.md
.br
.B pagina
.BR \-\-help | \-h | help
.br
.B pagina
.BR \-\-version | \-v | version
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B pagina
converts Markdown to HTML
.RB ( to\-html )
and HTML back to Markdown
.RB ( to\-md ).
Use
.B \-
as the input to read from stdin, or as the output to write to stdout.
Colors are applied to help text and error messages only; converted output
is never colorized.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-gfm
Enable GFM extensions (task lists, strikethrough, bare autolinks,
footnotes, deflists, math).
Pipe tables render with or without
.B \-\-gfm
(spec-neutral exception).
May also be enabled with
.B gfm
in
.IR pagina.toml ;
the flag overrides the file.
.TP
.BR \-\-color =\fIWHEN\fR
Colorize help and error messages:
.BR auto
(default, TTY only),
.BR always ,
or
.BR never .
May appear before or after the subcommand, in
.BI \-\-color= WHEN
or
.BI \-\-color " " WHEN
form. Overrides the
.B color
key in
.IR pagina.toml .
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print help information.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Print version information.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ./pagina.toml
Per-directory config; takes precedence when present.
.TP
.I ~/.config/pagina/config.toml
User-level config, used when
.I ./pagina.toml
is absent.
.PP
Keys:
.B gfm
(bool),
.B color
(auto|always|never). CLI flags override the file; unknown keys are ignored.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Convert a file:
.RS
.nf
pagina to-html README.md README.html
pagina to-md page.html page.md
.fi
.RE
.PP
GFM extensions and stdin/stdout:
.RS
.nf
pagina to-html --gfm notes.md notes.html
cat file.md | pagina to-html - output.html
pagina to-html file.md -
.fi
.RE
.PP
Force or suppress colors:
.RS
.nf
pagina --color=always to-html notes.md notes.html
pagina --color=never to-md page.html page.md
.fi
.RE
.SH EXIT STATUS
.B 0
on success,
.B 1
on conversion, I/O, or argument errors.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pagina --help ,
project README (usage and API reference).
.PP
Note: output preserves raw HTML and javascript:/data: URLs per CommonMark \-
sanitize before browser/email rendering.
